{"nodes": [{"id": "sdd_final_fixes_report_final_fixes", "label": "Final Review Fixes: feature/supabase-weekly-backup", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/final-fixes-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "sdd_final_fixes_report_backup_attempt_mark", "label": "backup_attempt Mark: Two Attempts per Week", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/final-fixes-report.md", "source_location": "### 1. \u0421\u0442\u0456\u0439\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u0437\u0431\u0456\u0439 \u0440\u0435\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0457\u0432\u0441\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u0436\u043d\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0442\u0438\u043a\u0443", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gating on the success mark alone meant a persistent failure retried on every cron tick: the external cron knocks every ~10 minutes, so from Saturday 07:00 to end of Sunday the branch would run about 246 times \u2014 246 full dumps of eight Supabase reads each and 246 admin-topic messages. A second cron_state mark keyed on the attempt, at day granularity and written before the run, reduces this to the intended two attempts per week while keeping the Sunday catch-up. The third parameter of is_backup_due is deliberately required with no default so a caller cannot silently forget it, and no date comparison leaked into the dispatcher. No migration needed: cron_state is key/value with upsert on conflict."}], "edges": [{"source": "sdd_final_fixes_report_final_fixes", "target": "specs_2026_08_18_supabase_backup_design_spec", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/final-fixes-report.md", "source_location": "\u0421\u043f\u0435\u043a\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0430 \u0443 \u0432\u0456\u0434\u043f\u043e\u0432\u0456\u0434\u043d\u0456\u0441\u0442\u044c", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "sdd_final_fixes_report_final_fixes", "target": "sdd_final_fixes_report_backup_attempt_mark", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/final-fixes-report.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_backup_is_backup_due", "target": "sdd_final_fixes_report_backup_attempt_mark", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/final-fixes-report.md", "source_location": "\u0420\u0456\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_backup_send_weekly_backup", "target": "specs_2026_08_18_supabase_backup_design_loud_failure", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/final-fixes-report.md", "source_location": "\u041d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439 BACKUP_CHAT_ID", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_08_19_ai_grounded_context_design_rate_limit", "target": "sdd_final_fixes_report_backup_attempt_mark", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": ".superpowers/sdd/final-fixes-report.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}